<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>纽约时报 实时热点</title><link>https://rss.nytimes.com/services/xml/rss/nyt/HomePage.xml</link><description>纽约时报 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Sat, 28 Nov 2026 12:30:02 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>由于停电和暴风雨，一些美国人取消或推迟了感恩节晚餐。</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/27/us/thanksgiving-delayed-storm.html</link><description>由于停电和暴风雨，一些美国人取消或推迟了感恩节晚餐。他们被重新安排到周五、周六及以后。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [纽约时报] &lt;a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/27/us/thanksgiving-delayed-storm.html'&gt;由于停电和暴风雨，一些美国人取消或推迟了感恩节晚餐。&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Some Americans canceled or postponed Thanksgiving dinners amid power outages and storms.&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/27/us/thanksgiving-delayed-storm.html</guid><pubDate>Sat, 28 Nov 2026 02:07:54 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>我为梅西百货感恩节游行进行的气球训练</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/25/podcasts/the-daily/dont-let-go-my-balloon-training-for-the-macys-thanksgiving-day-parade.html</link><description>在第 100 届阅兵式上，我们的东道主驾驶了它的标志之一。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [纽约时报] &lt;a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/25/podcasts/the-daily/dont-let-go-my-balloon-training-for-the-macys-thanksgiving-day-parade.html'&gt;我为梅西百货感恩节游行进行的气球训练&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：My Balloon Training for the Macy’s Thanksgiving Day Parade&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/25/podcasts/the-daily/dont-let-go-my-balloon-training-for-the-macys-thanksgiving-day-parade.html</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 10:15:43 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>从臭名昭著的叙利亚监狱获释，但仍被恐怖所困</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/28/world/middleeast/freed-from-a-notorious-syrian-prison-but-still-trapped-by-its-terror.html</link><description>艾哈迈德·沙勒预计将在塞德纳亚监狱中死去。十年后突然获释，他陶醉于婚姻和父亲身份，但却难以摆脱内心的阴影。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [纽约时报] &lt;a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/28/world/middleeast/freed-from-a-notorious-syrian-prison-but-still-trapped-by-its-terror.html'&gt;从臭名昭著的叙利亚监狱获释，但仍被恐怖所困&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Freed From a Notorious Syrian Prison, but Still Trapped by Its Terror&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/28/world/middleeast/freed-from-a-notorious-syrian-prison-but-still-trapped-by-its-terror.html</guid><pubDate>Sat, 28 Nov 2026 10:00:23 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>乌克兰的深度打击在俄罗斯及其他地区的规模和范围不断扩大</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/28/world/europe/ukraine-russia-long-range-strikes.html</link><description>一场旨在剥夺莫斯科战争机器燃料、武器和资金的运动受到了特朗普政府的批评。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [纽约时报] &lt;a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/28/world/europe/ukraine-russia-long-range-strikes.html'&gt;乌克兰的深度打击在俄罗斯及其他地区的规模和范围不断扩大&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Ukraine’s Deep Strikes Grow in Scale and Scope Across Russia and Beyond&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/28/world/europe/ukraine-russia-long-range-strikes.html</guid><pubDate>Sat, 28 Nov 2026 10:02:15 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>数百万儿童正在失去食品券</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/28/us/politics/millions-of-children-are-losing-food-stamps.html</link><description>共和党人表示，削减开支是其国内政策法案的一部分，将根除欺诈行为并推动成年人工作。但有 200 万儿童失去了福利。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [纽约时报] &lt;a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/28/us/politics/millions-of-children-are-losing-food-stamps.html'&gt;数百万儿童正在失去食品券&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Millions of Children Are Losing Food Stamps&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/28/us/politics/millions-of-children-are-losing-food-stamps.html</guid><pubDate>Sat, 28 Nov 2026 1